course: dictionary
lesson: 10815
title: A French word on the menu
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Some words are not English at all. «Veau» is a French noun, so it comes with a small word before it: le veau means the calf, and les veaux means the calves. You can work out a new word from another language the same way you work out an English word: look at the words around it.
explain: Look at the clue in the sentence: «Beef comes from bœuf, pork from porc, mutton from mouton and veal (calf meat) from veau.» The brackets tell you that veal is calf meat, so veau must link to calf. English has the same pattern: cow gives us beef, and pig gives us pork.
explain: French menus are full of clues. «Blanquette de veau» is a veal stew, so when you see veau on a menu, think calf or veal meat. Say it like «voh». English took the word veal from an old form of French, so the two words are cousins.
fact: «Veau» is a French noun, so it has a small word before it: le veau (the calf) and les veaux (the calves).
fact: «Veau» means calf, a baby cow, and also veal, the meat of a calf.
fact: «Veau» sounds like «voh», with a «v» at the start.
fact: English took the word «veal» from an old form of French, so «veal» and «veau» are related.
fact: On French menus, «blanquette de veau» is a veal stew.
exercise: «Beef comes from bœuf, pork from porc, mutton from mouton and veal (calf meat) from veau.» What does veau mean? | Pig | Sheep | Cow | *Calf and veal
exercise: On a French menu you see «blanquette de veau». What kind of dish is it? | A fish soup | A pig pudding | A cheese pie | *A veal stew
exercise: In a French farm list, «la vache» means cow and «le taureau» means bull. What does «le veau» mean? | Bull | Horse | Cow | *Calf
test: Is «veau» an English word? | It is a Scottish word | It is a name for a farm | *No, it is a French word | Yes, it is in every English dictionary
test: How do you say "the calves" in French? | le veau | le taureau | *les veaux | la vache
exam: In the sentence about beef, pork and veal, which clue tells you what veau means? | The sentence is long | *The brackets say veal (calf meat) | The word starts with a v | It is on a menu
